    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ea27b853589d8ab93360fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我已经拼尽全力试图解说她的优点……\r\n但看样子，她似乎并没有将我说的话当真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5edca722da3247f83b25fad87e5906abff7e945b28cf669dc4c5c7e7818d985",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a05f5b05bbe70992fd1e91b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我暂时无法了解她这自卑的原因。\r\n是因为原本就性格如此吗，\r\n还是说无法在比赛中拿出战果招致了这样的结果呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "71e64fea3215bcb053ec48ac8a96f651867a438f502903c68d6151e071dd2ddb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
