      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b34b31d884c69c6efe516c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但无论如何，前几日我所见的那副走投无路的模样，\r\n大概就是因这『令人震惊的自卑』所导致的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08197fd7921298c91759c1a3797d2ae4ad836fbbf34a32166e05d42d9bfefee9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
